    "title":  "Recipe for Disaster",
    "description":  "The Dark Brotherhood tasks the player with killing the Gourmet, a famous chef whose identity is secret, in order to impersonate him and poison the Emperor\u0027s meal. The player must extract the Gourmet\u0027s identity from Anton Virane, silence him, then assassinate the Gourmet and steal his Writ of Passage.",
